.TH ZEETERM 1 "" "ZeeTerm" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
zeeterm \- SSH, SFTP and serial terminal client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zeeterm
.RB [ \-\-version | \-V ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ZeeTerm
is a native graphical SSH client with a terminal workspace, SFTP file management, remote editing, port forwarding and X11 forwarding.
Telnet and serial connections are also supported.
.PP
Without arguments the application window opens.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-version ", " \-V
Print the program name and version, then exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ZSSH_DATA_DIR
Directory for hosts, settings and the credential store.
Default: \fB$XDG_DATA_HOME/ZeeTerm\fR (usually \fB~/.local/share/ZeeTerm\fR).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lib/zeeterm/zssh-mcp
Tool bridge for external AI agents.
It must stay in the same directory as
.BR zeeterm .
.SH SEE ALSO
Project page: https://github.com/MoeShinX/ZeeTerm
.SH LICENSE
GPL-3.0-or-later.
